  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## v3.19.2 (patch)\n\nChanges since v3.19.1:\n\n- Write static properties that compile in C++ and are reachable from the class in Python [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Build the splice test's paths with Path.Join ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Truncate Python integer division in integer arithmetic so long quotients stay exact [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Spell NaN and infinite float literals in every target language [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- End a C/C++ comment line that would splice on a non-splice character [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
